@startuml timing-bit-transfer
title Bit transfer: DATA changes while CLK is low, sampled on the rising edge
binary "CLK" as CLK
binary "DATA" as DATA

@0
CLK is low
DATA is high

@10
CLK is high

@20
CLK is low

@22
DATA is low

@30
CLK is high

@40
CLK is low

@42
DATA is high

@50
CLK is high

@60
CLK is low

@70
DATA is high
@enduml
